-### Joined acceptance scenarios
-
-**A. Routine two-project exchange.** Use one coordination authority, two isolated repositories and team/project assignments selected by U1. App-team feature waits on an explicit compiler-team fix condition. The app member files through the compiler team's public interface without knowing its internals. Compiler triages/decomposes and files a separate discovery; containment alone creates no prerequisite. Compiler requests clarification back through the app interface. The clarification is eligible despite the app feature's blocker, carries the specific return address and original Job/phase/request, and its authorized answer resumes only the relevant retained phase. Complete independent fix review and the explicitly required human integration; exact usable accepted revision releases the feature to normal scheduler admission. No courier act or repeated routine permission. Exercise missing member fallback to configured project/team/operator with one accountable obligation.
-
-**B. Real exceptional case.** Execute the malformed-planning-verifier scenario in section4 with deterministic provider/output and real coordination/verification boundaries. Automatic analysis → owner options → explicit decision → supported retained recovery → independent review. Preserve original failure, candidate and all IDs; no repeated provider implementation merely to fix an argv. This case must pass without coordinator/agent rescue arranging the analysis/review handoff.
-
-**C. Lifecycle and template authority.** A defect starts from the selected sequence; a proposed phase insertion is reviewed but cannot apply without owner approval. A proposed reusable template cannot publish without owner approval. Ordinary approved-phase progression does not request another permission. Completed phase evidence survives revisions and user-visible Job acceptance remains distinct from execution completion.
-
-**D. Pool control.** Busy alternate review waits; transient provider refusal pauses affected work while new assignments still queue. After persistent trouble, the owner selects an individual move or scoped redirect. Prove all-role applicability, same-vendor/weaker standby option without weakened acceptance, disclosed same-model independent review, persistent project/team/global precedence and no failback. Healthy executions finish on the old pool with their original results; queued and future work follow the selected destination. Limits affect only new starts; zero does not kill active work or suppress queue admission. No autonomous switch or inferred global scope.
-
-**Negative/restart branches:** use separate fixture identities for cancellation/rejection versus successful completion; do not cancel then revive the same execution. Bind each fixture to an explicit compatible finite profile. The existing one-continuation profile must not be used to imply unlimited question/escalation loops; either bound the scenario to its allowance or select a new immutable profile before dependent execution. Faults at request/disposition/decision/queue-move/continuation/satisfaction cuts preserve attribution and exact retry semantics without double writers or duplicate obligations. Wrong grants, stale decisions, foreign Work, wrong candidate, incompatible bases and unavailable/unknown cessation refuse or remain held. Prove principal-global capacity at admission/release, not by holding an owner claim throughout the scenario.
-
-Count human acts by category, not an invented constant: decisions, approved plan/template changes, selected pool operations and human integration are permitted; every ordinary request/answer/review delivery and analysis dispatch must have zero courier acts. Policy-approved transitions are system-driven. Use deterministic fake/replay providers at their normal boundary and disposable isolated repositories; preserve measured timings, exact source/candidate/manifest identity, collected/executed/outcome accounting, unknowns and evidence limitations. No live model, actual installed instance change, broad suite or stress campaign is authorized merely by this plan.
